  migration: "The Poconos, Lehigh Valley, and Bucks County absorb a steady stream of New York and New Jersey households trading commute time for housing cost. Philadelphia gains young professionals and loses families to the suburbs. Pittsburgh has stabilized after decades of decline, gaining on healthcare, robotics, and university employment. Outbound flow from the state runs to Florida, the Carolinas, and Texas, heavily weighted toward retirees.",
