  seasonal: "Peak is May through August with a State College spike in mid-August. Winter is quiet but the mountain sections of I-80 and the Turnpike see serious snow, and Erie's lake-effect belt is among the snowiest in the country. Philadelphia and Pittsburgh handle winter reasonably well. October is the best month statewide for weather, price, and availability.",
